ee (SK) and SPO pages in plain folders, a printed document map table, and a laptop showing the package's Excel self-assessment (a long list of assessment rows with colored status cells and a bar chart per chapter). Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Small hospital archive room: tall grey metal cabinets, rows of old thick binders with faded spines (no readable text), a light layer of dust on the top shelf, a narrow window with daylight, a small meeting table with a laptop; then the same room's table tidied. No other people. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · close-up: her hand pulls a dusty binder from a metal shelf; cut to medium shot as she turns to the camera holding it. VO (ID, verbatim): "Akreditasi kami habis tahun depan." Delivery (EN): calm, serious 2–4s Problem · medium shot, she blows a little dust off the binder top. VO (ID, verbatim): "Tim yang dulu sudah pindah semua." Delivery (EN): honest, a little wistful 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, she flips a few yellowed pages (no readable text). VO (ID, verbatim): "Dokumen lamanya banyak yang usang." Delivery (EN): concerned 6–8s Problem · medium shot, she closes the binder and looks at the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Mulai dari mana dulu?" Delivery (EN): thoughtful 8–10s Beat · medium shot, she sets the binder on the table and pulls out a chair. VO: none. AUDIO: Quiet archive room, metal cabinet door creak, paper rustle. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, relaxed movements. CLEAN OUTPUT: No subtitles, captions, generated text overlays, watermark, poster layout, storyboard panels, or added graphics. Do not invent product details, claims, prices, ratings, testimonials, certifications, or guarantees. Keep exact talent face, the WARDROBE above, product shape, colors, packaging, box title, printed folders, laptop screen, laptop screen content, and visual details consistent with the DNA references.